,"height":36},{"text":"일련의","x":1336,"y":726,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"주소","x":1443,"y":728,"width":61,"height":32}]},{"text":"만 언급하기로 한다.","words":[{"text":"만","x":300,"y":782,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"언급하기로","x":343,"y":782,"width":147,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":500,"y":784,"width":65,"height":35}]},{"text":"메모리 관리와 연관되는 여러 쟁점, 즉 기본적인 하드웨어 쟁점, 기호(또는 가상) 메","words":[{"text":"메모리","x":358,"y":840,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"관리와","x":458,"y":841,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"연관되는","x":559,"y":842,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"여러","x":686,"y":842,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"쟁점,","x":756,"y":842,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"즉","x":835,"y":845,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"기본적인","x":880,"y":843,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"하드웨어","x":1012,"y":844,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"쟁점,","x":1149,"y":844,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"기호(또는","x":1235,"y":844,"width":141,"height":36},{"text":"가상)","x":1389,"y":842,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"메","x":1475,"y":843,"width":26,"height":35}]},{"text":"모리 주소와 실제 물리 주소와의 연결, 그리고 논리 주소와 물리 주소의 구분 등을 다루","words":[{"text":"모리","x":302,"y":898,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"주소와","x":372,"y":899,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"실제","x":475,"y":899,"width":54,"height":35},{"text":"물리","x":543,"y":899,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"주소와의","x":613,"y":900,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"연결,","x":746,"y":900,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"그리고","x":824,"y":901,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"논리","x":926,"y":903,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"주소와","x":1000,"y":903,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"물리","x":1104,"y":902,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"주소의","x":1180,"y":902,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"구분","x":1289,"y":902,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"등을","x":1368,"y":901,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"다루","x":1445,"y":900,"width":59,"height":36}]},{"text":"는 것으로부터 논의를 시작한다. 코드와 공유 라이브러리의 동적 적재와 연결에 관한 논","words":[{"text":"는","x":302,"y":957,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":